@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Free shipping for First-Time Buyers - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Buying";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Shipping";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Free shipping for First-Time Buyers";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('/help_centre_img/help_area/help_centre_hero_bg.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>If you're new to Lively, you may qualify for free shipping (up to $25) on your first purchase. The credit is automatically applied at checkout. No code or setup required.</p>

        <div class="article-info-box">
            <strong>Note:</strong> Incentives, including free shipping for first-time buyers, may change over time.
        </div>

        <h2 id="qualify">How do I qualify?</h2>

        <p>You're eligible if:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>You're a new buyer in the United States</li>
            <li>You're using the Lively iOS or Android app</li>
            <li>You're making your first purchase on Lively</li>
            <li>You're within 60 days of sign-up</li>
            <li>You didn't sign up with a referral link</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Eligible buyers may see "Free Shipping" highlighted throughout the app, including in Discovery, live shows, pinned listings, and Buy It Now checkout.</p>

        <div class="article-image-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <h2 id="sellers">What this means for sellers</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>No setup is required.</li>
            <li>Sellers aren't charged for this incentive.</li>
            <li>Shipping rates and your shipping settings remain the same.</li>
            <li>Payout timing and processes are unchanged.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="faq">Frequently asked questions (FAQs)</h2>

        <h3>Is this available for my first purchase with each seller?</h3>
        <p>No. Free shipping applies only to your first purchase on Lively overall.</p>

        <h3>What if I don't use the credit right away?</h3>
        <p>The credit expires 60 days after signup. After that, it's no longer available.</p>

        <h3>What if shipping costs more than $25?</h3>
        <p>You'll receive a $25 credit and pay any remaining shipping balance.</p>

        <h3>I signed up with a referral link. Why don't I see free shipping?</h3>
        <p>Buyers who sign up using a referral link are not eligible for the first-time buyer free shipping incentive.</p>

        <h3>Do sellers need to opt in?</h3>
        <p>No. The incentive is applied automatically for eligible buyers.</p>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>80 out of 145 found this helpful</span>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
